---
title: Melitta pour over by Corner Coffee Store
source: https://cornercoffeestore.com/melitta-pour-over-instructions/
filter: paper, number 4 cone
---

@Melitta 0.7oz 12floz 195-205°F
grind medium-fine

/rinse
/level-bed -- tap the sides
/wait ~30s -- bloom: a little water from the center outward, to wet all the grounds
12floz spiral -- from the center outward, until the cup is full

target 3:30 -- 3 to 4 minutes
